    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/a4ab014fd9efc1cb0afd34625726a0f7.avif?t=1755109929\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/df274acec2d3f180a199f4674feae36a.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEBABSTAR: MORE THAN A GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the extraordinary and epic journey of a humble kebab seller who becomes an AI agent after losing everything in the desert. All the animals in the world have tragically been captured by the Ice Cream Cult and are being used by a powerful AI corporation for creating the super language model. Your mission? To destroy this sinister cult and the tech company behind it \u2014 deep within the Cyprus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flipping kebabs on the streets to partying in luxury parties, you\u2019ll rise through the ranks and transform into an elite AI Agent. In this epic and hilarious simulation, <strong>cook\u00a0</strong>kebabs, <strong>charm</strong> the ladies, and <strong>shoot</strong> the <strong>fire</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/455ee99a8e5946156440172dcad16581.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEEL YOUR REAL HANDS AND COOKING LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just an agent \u2014 you're stepping into the full cooking experience, one step at a time. <strong>Feel</strong> the grip of the knife, <strong>hold</strong> the pan, <strong>mix</strong> the ingredients, and become a <strong>true chef</strong> as you master the <strong>art of kebab-making</strong>. Unlike any other game, Kebabstar uses advanced <i>inverse kinematics</i> to deliver a <i>hyper-realistic cooking</i> experience where your hero\u2019s hands move just like your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/9977616b54d490532c206276bbe402dd.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROLEPLAY AS CHEF AND AI AGENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just an ordinary kebab master, you\u2019re the <strong>hero</strong> of a <strong>wild tale</strong> <strong>rising</strong> to <strong>superstardom</strong>. With <strong>hilarious</strong>, <strong>funny</strong>, and <strong>unforgettable characters</strong>, we\u2019re not exaggerating\u00a0 <i>you\u2019ll feel them</i> living inside you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM KEBAB MASTER TO AI AGENT - AN UNIQUE STORYLINE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you master the art of kebab-making, outsmart your rivals for your own gain, and become a social media sensation, you discover that your beloved camel was kidnapped by a dark cult named Ice Cream Cult and prisoned at the island. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN ACTION-SIM FILLED WITH ADVENTURE, LOVE &amp; COMEDY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing everything, you put on a mysterious pair of glasses and suddenly find yourself at a luxury party \u2014 with nothing left to your name. From the deserts to Cyprus, you\u2019ll meet a blind man and begin an epic, super journey into the world of artificial intelligence espionage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/4250200310cab2bc94c9d6befa4682a6.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXCLUSIVE GRAPHICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to be blown away by the stunning visuals of Kebabstar. Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers an unmatched level of realism and immersion that transports you to a world like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD THAT FEELS ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene in Kebabstar is crafted with incredible attention to detail \u2014 from the bustling vendors of the Grand Bazaar to the sizzling grills of kebab stands. As you explore the vibrant world of Kebabstar, you\u2019ll encounter characters and environments that feel so real, it\u2019s like stepping into another life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of stepping into a world where every kebab stand, lively setting, and eccentric character feels truly lifelike. This isn\u2019t just one location \u2014 you\u2019ll journey through Arabia, Dubai, Istanbul, and the  Cyprus, each with its own flavor of realism and storylines action.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/8c7ac177beb4effc3deb6a8810f1429d.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/a4ab014fd9efc1cb0afd34625726a0f7.avif?t=1755109929\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/df274acec2d3f180a199f4674feae36a.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEBABSTAR: MORE THAN A GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the extraordinary and epic journey of a humble kebab seller who becomes an AI agent after losing everything in the desert. All the animals in the world have tragically been captured by the Ice Cream Cult and are being used by a powerful AI corporation for creating the super language model. Your mission? To destroy this sinister cult and the tech company behind it \u2014 deep within the Cyprus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flipping kebabs on the streets to partying in luxury parties, you\u2019ll rise through the ranks and transform into an elite AI Agent. In this epic and hilarious simulation, <strong>cook\u00a0</strong>kebabs, <strong>charm</strong> the ladies, and <strong>shoot</strong> the <strong>fire</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/fbd0998bad78c408d1417ae9949568c2.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/455ee99a8e5946156440172dcad16581.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEEL YOUR REAL HANDS AND COOKING LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just an agent \u2014 you're stepping into the full cooking experience, one step at a time. <strong>Feel</strong> the grip of the knife, <strong>hold</strong> the pan, <strong>mix</strong> the ingredients, and become a <strong>true chef</strong> as you master the <strong>art of kebab-making</strong>. Unlike any other game, Kebabstar uses advanced <i>inverse kinematics</i> to deliver a <i>hyper-realistic cooking</i> experience where your hero\u2019s hands move just like your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.poster.avif?t=1755109929\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.webm?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/d24b43be5e16e5bb6ca5ca5af967eded.mp4?t=1755109929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/9977616b54d490532c206276bbe402dd.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROLEPLAY AS CHEF AND AI AGENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just an ordinary kebab master, you\u2019re the <strong>hero</strong> of a <strong>wild tale</strong> <strong>rising</strong> to <strong>superstardom</strong>. With <strong>hilarious</strong>, <strong>funny</strong>, and <strong>unforgettable characters</strong>, we\u2019re not exaggerating\u00a0 <i>you\u2019ll feel them</i> living inside you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM KEBAB MASTER TO AI AGENT - AN UNIQUE STORYLINE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you master the art of kebab-making, outsmart your rivals for your own gain, and become a social media sensation, you discover that your beloved camel was kidnapped by a dark cult named Ice Cream Cult and prisoned at the island. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN ACTION-SIM FILLED WITH ADVENTURE, LOVE &amp; COMEDY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing everything, you put on a mysterious pair of glasses and suddenly find yourself at a luxury party \u2014 with nothing left to your name. From the deserts to Cyprus, you\u2019ll meet a blind man and begin an epic, super journey into the world of artificial intelligence espionage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451190/extras/4250200310cab2bc94c9d6befa4682a6.avif?t=1755109929\" /></span>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXCLUSIVE GRAPHICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to be blown away by the stunning visuals of Kebabstar. Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers an unmatched level of realism and immersion that transports you to a world like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD THAT FEELS ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene in Kebabstar is crafted with incredible attention to detail \u2014 from the bustling vendors of the Grand Bazaar to the sizzling grills of kebab stands. As you explore the vibrant world of Kebabstar, you\u2019ll encounter characters and environments that feel so real, it\u2019s like stepping into another life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of stepping into a world where every kebab stand, lively setting, and eccentric character feels truly lifelike. This isn\u2019t just one location \u2014 you\u2019ll journey through Arabia, Dubai, Istanbul, and the  Cyprus, each with its own flavor of realism and storylines action.</p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash sizzling mayhem in this epic parody cooking-adventure! When the Ice Cream Cult kidnaps your beloved camel, slice, sizzle, and swipe through frosty foes. Satisfy vengeance and hunger on a savory quest to dethrone dessert tyrants! Join the kebab crusade now!",
